  "ballsVisible": true,
  "notes": "Two end zones, three defenders in the middle. Reds keep the ball in one end zone, then look for the moment to play through or over the middle into the far zone.\n\nCoaching points:\n- Keep width and depth in the zone so there is always a spare pass.\n- Move the ball quickly to shift the defenders, then play through when a lane opens.\n- Defenders press together; the far one screens the long pass.\n\nThis drill came with the app. Change it, save it as your own, or delete it.",
